          "text": "b7",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": ". This window is the only one that holds three of each — nine of its eighteen dots, exactly half, are one of those three degrees, more than any other window carries, both in count and in proportion. Counted string by string, not assumed."
