        {
          "text": " strings, a fret below the window's bottom edge. In this one window the chapter's central pair straddles the frame: the note that leans sits inside, and the note it leans onto sits outside, a fret short of the box. This is the only window where that happens against an open string. Two more dots here are missing their one-fret partner too — "
